&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with mobile gaming companies across hypercasual, casual, mid-core, or hardcore mobile gaming categories.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Background in mobile user acquisition, app marketing, or mobile gaming business development.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with mobile gaming conferences and industry events.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
