&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;4-6+ years of Product Marketing experience in the advertising space, ideally with experience building and scaling ad platform capabilities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;2+ years of experience leading reporting and analytics initiatives, including defining KPI frameworks, partnering with Data Science on dashboard development, and shaping measurement strategies that drive product and business outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excel in ambiguous environments—excited about building new processes, business models, and scaling an advertising business from the ground up.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
