&lt;li&gt;Experience with ETL and Data Orchestration Pipelines (e.g. Airflow, Dagster)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience developing, operating, and debugging distributed systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building or integrating with privacy management and legal compliance platforms&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
